00:05:10,588 --> 00:05:16,588
The Stranger in My Home is a thriller, drama film directed by Jeff Fisher.

2
00:10:21,176 --> 00:10:27,176
A handsome stranger's claim that a couple's 15-year-old daughter was switched at birth
throws their perfect family into turmoil, unearthing shattering secrets.

3
