00:46:35,294 --> 00:46:41,294
Die My Love is a 2025 American psychological drama film directed by Lynne
Ramsay, who co-wrote the screenplay with Enda Walsh and Alice Birch.

10
00:51:45,882 --> 00:51:51,882
Based on the 2012 novel by Ariana Harwicz, it follows a young mother (Jennifer Lawrence) in rural Montana whose severe
postpartum depression and psychosis unravel her marriage to her husband (Robert Pattinson) and her grip on reality.

11
00:56:56,470 --> 00:57:02,470
The supporting cast includes LaKeith Stanfield, Nick Nolte, and Sissy Spacek.

12
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
Die My Love had its world premiere at the 2025 Cannes Film Festival on
May 17, 2025, where it was nominated for the Palme d'Or.

13
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
It received generally positive reviews from critics,
with praise for Lawrence's performance.

14
01:12:28,235 --> 01:12:34,235
At the 83rd Golden Globe Awards, Lawrence was nominated for
Best Actress in a Motion Picture – Drama.

15
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
It was theatrically released in the United States by Mubi on November 7, 2025.

16
01:22:49,411 --> 01:22:55,411
The tone is emotional and intense.
